<title>USA: Cincinnati Financial names CFO.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Financial names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cincinnati Financial Corp said on Monday that Theodore Elchynski was named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Elchynski, who is senior vice president, secretary and treasurer, is replacing Robert Driehaus, the company said.</p>
